<title>JAPAN: Okura &amp; Co up on computer repair hopes.</title>
<headline>Okura &amp; Co up on computer repair hopes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Okura &amp; Co Ltd shares rose on the Tokyo Stock Exchange on Thursday morning because of hopes that the company would solve computer problems related to the year 2000, traders said.</p>
<p>By 0052 GMT, Okura's shares rose 15 yen to 510 yen.</p>
<p>Okura has formed a joint venture with a software company to solve problems regarding computer recognition of the years after 2000, traders said without elaborating.</p>
